# Persona portraits: the public-safe `pete` cast ships as plaintext SVG under
# src/renderer/assets/personas/pete/. The show-likeness tiers are NOT stored as
# viewable images — they live ENCRYPTED in src/renderer/assets/vault/ (AES-GCM,
# keyed on the scavenger-hunt answers; see src/shared/imageVault.ts). Never commit
# a plaintext show-likeness raster to this public repo.

# scratch/ holds throwaway build outputs (e.g. the bundled vault tool — see
# scripts/vault-tool.ts for the esbuild command); nothing in it is tracked.
scratch/
